 Kurau's Rynax energy.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/80817/379144.jpg"},{"title":"The Frozen River","episodeNumber":21,"sourceEpisodeNumber":21,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"1810","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[21]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"483","episodeNumbers":[21]},{"provider":"mal","id":"483","episodeNumbers":[21]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"31692","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[21]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"80817","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[21]}],"link":"97022","synopsis":"Director Saito has perfected his newest crop of GPO soldiers. Kurau and Christmas continue to chase the Delyus twins. The twins, however, manage to separate Kurau and Christmas from each other, leaving them more vulnerable. But the pair are not in this fight alone. Ayaka Steiger has something special up her sleeve, to assist them in capturing the twins.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/80817/379145.jpg"},{"title":"Shine in the Darkness","episodeNumber":22,"sourceEpisodeNumber":22,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"1810","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[22]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"483","episodeNumbers":[22]},{"provider":"mal","id":"483","episodeNumbers":[22]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"31692","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[22]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"80817","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[22]}],"link":"97023","synopsis":"The twins learn what it is to be human. What price will they pay for this unbearable knowledge?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/80817/379146.jpg"},{"title":"The Light at the End","episodeNumber":23,"sourceEpisodeNumber":23,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"1810","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[23]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"483","episodeNumbers":[23]},{"provider":"mal","id":"483","episodeNumbers":[23]},{"provider"